    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Hogan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114401624728012512972/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUTi0L63CYGS5m5EPL_Jv0uj9gYFqeodrVomYle6bo5Ey5nn7Ck=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I called Mediagrafix after a Google search of businesses in the area for printing larger media, like posters. I spoke to the owner (Marco) directly as well as shared email exchanges and he had me send him the digital file in question via email, confirmed that it was good enough to use for what I wanted and then he offered me some options for the print. I could not be happier with the outcome, it has exceeded my expectations. Marco produces excellent work, is very friendly to deal with and it reasonably priced. Marco is capable of producing a wide range of sizes, including large commercial window treatments and more. The whole experience has been excellent and I am planning to have him do some more prints for me.",
        "time": 1765940043,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "olivia fuller",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115436302989381312474/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWoDU1-1Auw3uUn9633iAtPgPDIeboTqrt3iuxh6LjKPl_6cKA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Outstanding Service and Quality!\n\nMarcos and his team at the print shop consistently deliver top-notch results. Their attention to detail, quick turnaround times, and exceptional customer service set them apart from the rest. I've used their services multiple times and have always been impressed. Highly recommend to anyone looking for reliable and high-quality printing.\n\nNothing beats Marco and his team’s dedication and professionalism!",
        "time": 1754501462,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dimitra Katsourinis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100633003187542473796/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDf8z08eVEFFqtopOSw4iBiRhAi9b4bIrqnAKu8l6jVq7xbeof=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Marco and his team. They did our front office window, our trailer and all of our trucks. They were professional, quick and efficient. The quality of their work is excellent. You wont be disappointed.",
        "time": 1761914899,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "48Media",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106796813119211162716/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnYYdzop_M8ITE1v7xyq0WlgNwl9FR8KvqD_ufOkpru1A5UWI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Best print shop out there! Fast delivery, premium quality, and outstanding service every time. Marco and his team are true professionals who always get the job done right. Nothing beats the level of care and attention they put into their work. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1754501190,
        "translated": false
